WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.438
Question twenty.

00:00:01.438 --> 00:00:08.717
Step one: macro scan. It asks the format for a transparent, simply animated logo.

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:12.401
One mark. Command words: “more suitable”.

00:00:12.401 --> 00:00:14.019
Step two: denoise.

00:00:14.019 --> 00:00:19.950
Useful, in yellow: transparent background, simple frame animation.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:24.174
In cyan: “both at once”, plus the bracket hint.

00:00:24.174 --> 00:00:28.397
Useless red herring: logo design — kick it out.

00:00:28.397 --> 00:00:30.015
Step three: draft.

00:00:30.015 --> 00:00:32.531
Condition one: transparency.

00:00:32.531 --> 00:00:35.407
Condition two: simple animation.

00:00:35.407 --> 00:00:37.474
Both, at the same time.

00:00:37.474 --> 00:00:39.002
Step four: P O E.

00:00:39.002 --> 00:00:42.057
A, J P E G: no transparency — cut.

00:00:42.057 --> 00:00:45.742
B, B M P: ruled out by the bracket — cut.

00:00:45.742 --> 00:00:49.606
D, T I F F: ruled out by the bracket — cut.

00:00:49.606 --> 00:00:57.694
Step five: sanity check and lock. Only the remaining format meets both conditions at once.

00:00:57.694 --> 00:01:00.120
So the correct answer is C.
